@codeGroupId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@assetRequestId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Health: Root check
GET {{HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/plain

### Health: Database check
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/health/db
Accept: application/json

### Import: Upload spreadsheet
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="майно.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ../../майно.xlsx
--boundary--

###

# ===================================================================
# Ledger rows and Code Groups API
# ===================================================================

### Ledger rows: First page (default 25 rows)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries
Accept: application/json

> {%
    if (response.body.items && response.body.items.length > 0) {
        if (response.body.items[0].codes.length > 0) {
            client.global.set("codeGroupId", response.body.items[0].codes[0].id);
        }
        client.global.set("ledgerEntryId", response.body.items[0].id);
    }
%}

### Ledger rows: Search by accountant code
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries?search=1113&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Ledger rows: Search by source name
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries?search=Стілець&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Ledger rows: Filter by registered status
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries?status=registered&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Ledger rows: Filter by partial status
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries?status=partial&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Ledger rows: Filter by unregistered status
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries?status=unregistered&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Ledger rows: Custom pagination
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries?page=2&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Ledger row: Detail with codes and registered assets
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries/{{ledgerEntryId}}
Accept: application/json

### Ledger row: Detail (404 Not Found check)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Ledger rows: Invalid pagination (400 Bad Request check)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries?page=0&pageSize=25
Accept: application/json

### Ledger rows: Invalid status filter (400 Bad Request check)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ledger-entries?status=invalid_status
Accept: application/json

###

# ===================================================================
# Asset Registration API
# ===================================================================

### Asset Registration: Register physical assets with MVO under code group
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeGroupId": "{{codeGroupId}}",
  "requestId": "{{assetRequestId}}",
  "count": 3,
  "registeredForMvo": "Петренко О.В."
}

### Asset Registration: Idempotent replay (same RequestId, same parameters -> 200 OK)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeGroupId": "{{codeGroupId}}",
  "requestId": "{{assetRequestId}}",
  "count": 3,
  "registeredForMvo": "  петренко о.в.  "
}

### Asset Registration: Conflicting retry (same RequestId with different count -> 409 Conflict)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeGroupId": "{{codeGroupId}}",
  "requestId": "{{assetRequestId}}",
  "count": 5,
  "registeredForMvo": "Петренко О.В."
}

### Asset Registration: Conflicting retry (same RequestId with different MVO -> 409 Conflict)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeGroupId": "{{codeGroupId}}",
  "requestId": "{{assetRequestId}}",
  "count": 3,
  "registeredForMvo": "Іванов І.І."
}

### Asset Registration: Register assets with explicit null MVO
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeGroupId": "{{codeGroupId}}",
  "requestId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
  "count": 2,
  "registeredForMvo": null
}

### Asset Registration: Missing registeredForMvo property (400 Bad Request check)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeGroupId": "{{codeGroupId}}",
  "requestId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
  "count": 1
}

### Asset Registration: Invalid count boundary (400 Bad Request check)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeGroupId": "{{codeGroupId}}",
  "requestId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "count": 0,
  "registeredForMvo": "Петренко О.В."
}

### Asset Registration: Overlength MVO > 150 chars (400 Bad Request check)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeGroupId": "{{codeGroupId}}",
  "requestId": "66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666",
  "count": 1,
  "registeredForMvo": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA"
}

### Asset Registration: Non-existent code group (404 Not Found check)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeGroupId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "requestId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "count": 2,
  "registeredForMvo": "Петренко О.В."
}
